rkshop. This is easily do-able with a custom UI in sandbox mode.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671480/extras/e9f37a11b9aadd9ff67a3ec026d7815c.poster.avif?t=1741102773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671480/extras/e9f37a11b9aadd9ff67a3ec026d7815c.webm?t=1741102773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671480/extras/e9f37a11b9aadd9ff67a3ec026d7815c.mp4?t=1741102773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
